### Use with the "REST Client" extension in VS Code (or copy into Postman)
### 1) health
GET http://localhost:3001/health

### 2) register a bin (copy the returned "id" into the next requests)
POST http://localhost:3001/bins
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ownerUserId": "user-1", "deviceId": "device-001", "address": "Alamein", "thresholdPct": 80 }

### 3) send a reading below the threshold -> NORMAL
POST http://localhost:3001/bins/PASTE_BIN_ID/readings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fillPct": 50 }

### 4) send a reading at/above the threshold -> NEEDS_COLLECTION  (FR3.2)
POST http://localhost:3001/bins/PASTE_BIN_ID/readings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fillPct": 85 }

### 5) list bins that need collection
GET http://localhost:3001/bins/needing-collection

### 6) get one bin
GET http://localhost:3001/bins/PASTE_BIN_ID
